00:03:02.350 --> 00:03:05.870
We lampooned his bizarre interview with Jordan
Peterson.

00:03:05.870 --> 00:03:07.790
Like I've, I've not held back at all.

00:03:07.790 --> 00:03:14.680
I know that some of my progressive cohort,
some have some parts, elements of my progressive

